  "description": "750W Bafang Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi RV800plus is powered by a Bafang motor with 750W continuous and 1130W peak output, generating 100Nm of torque—strong enough to tackle steep inclines and rough trails effortlessly, making every ride an exciting adventure.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Li-ion Battery\n\nFeaturing advanced 21700 cells, the 48V 20Ah Samsung battery provides reliable, long-lasting power. With a 960Wh capacity, it can travel up to 70 km in full electric mode and 150 km with pedal assist. Its removable design makes charging convenient and supports longer rides.\n\nFull Suspension\n\nThe RV800Plus comes with a four-link suspension system and lockable coil forks, providing improved stability and a smooth, comfortable ride over rugged terrain for safer and more enjoyable adventures.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
